<concept id="new_dita_topic_prompt_dialog">
    <title>New DITA Topic Prompt Dialog</title>
    <conbody>
        <p>The <uicontrol>New DITA Topic</uicontrol> prompt dialog allows attaching images, PDF,
            Word or PowerPoint documents. There are some sample documents in: <xref
                href="https://github.com/oxygenxml-incubator/ai-positron-assistant-samples/tree/main/Convert"
                format="html" scope="external"/>.</p>
    </conbody>
</concept>